---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import {business} from '../data/site.js';
---
<Layout title="Order Cookies | Home is Cookie" description="Start a cookie order or corporate quote. Choose your cookies, send your requested date, and confirm pickup or delivery before payment.">
<section class="wrap page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">LET’S PLAN YOUR ORDER</p><h1>Good cookies begin<br/>with <em>a conversation.</em></h1><p class="intro">Choose what you’re planning, then continue to our Jotform. Availability, order details, and your total are confirmed before payment.</p></section><section class="wrap order-grid"><div><h2 style="font-size:38px">What’s the occasion?</h2><nav class="order-options" aria-label="Select order type"><a href="?type=corporate" data-order-type="corporate">Corporate gifts ↗</a><a href="?type=logo&quantity=12" data-order-type="logo">Logo & photo cookies ↗</a><a href="?type=tray" data-order-type="tray">Sharing tray ↗</a><a href="?type=stuffed" data-order-type="stuffed">Stuffed cookies ↗</a><a href="?type=sandwich" data-order-type="sandwich">Sandwich cookies ↗</a><a href="?type=cake" data-order-type="cake">Cookie cake ↗</a></nav><div class="callout"><h3>Before you continue</h3><p>Have your requested date, quantity, and pickup or delivery preference ready. Corporate orders need at least two weeks’ notice.</p><p>After approval, reserve your order with a 50% non-refundable deposit or pay the full approved amount.</p><a class="text-link" href="/order-terms/">Read order terms <span>↗</span></a></div></div><aside class="order-summary"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR STARTING POINT</p><h2 id="summary-title">Your cookie request</h2><label for="order-summary">Details to take to the form</label><textarea id="order-summary" readonly>I'd like to request a cookie order. Please confirm availability, quantities, and pickup or delivery.</textarea><button class="button outline" id="copy-summary">Copy these details <span>⧉</span></button><p id="copy-status" class="copy-status" role="status"></p><a class="button" href={business.jotform} target="_blank" rel="noopener" id="jotform-link">Continue to Jotform <span>↗</span></a><p class="small" style="margin-top:18px">Opens the existing order form in a new tab. Paste your copied details into its notes or special-request field. Your selection is not transferred automatically.</p><p class="notice">Prototype connection: the existing Jotform still needs pricing and approval-flow updates. This page does not submit an order or collect payment.</p><a class="text-link" href={'mailto:'+business.email}>Need help with an order? <span>↗</span></a></aside></section></Layout>
